diff --git a/vendor/postbox/README.md b/vendor/postbox/README.md
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/vendor/postbox/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Postbox 3.2.0, free edition
+
+A small client for the Postbox mail service. This copy is the free edition.
+
+## Sending
+
+`PostboxClient#send(recipients, subject, body)` sends 1 message to every address of `recipients` and returns 1 `DeliveryReceipt`. It accepts at most 50 recipients per call; a call with more throws `RecipientLimitExceeded` and sends nothing.
+
+`PostboxClient#sendWithAttachment(recipients, subject, body, attachment)` is a feature of the paid edition. In the free edition it throws `EditionFeatureMissing` and sends nothing.
+
+`DeliveryReceipt#sentAt()` returns the time the service accepted the message, in seconds since the epoch, in UTC.
+
+## Scheduled tasks
+
+`ScheduledTask` runs `runOnce()` by the cron expression it gets. Its constructor registers the task under its name at once, so the name must be known before the constructor of a subclass runs. Each name must be unique for each schedule: write it as `<task>@<cron expression>`, because 2 tasks of 1 name replace each other.
